{"s6770d01e7d15fe":"面包屑","s203c08e0d44ac3":"首页","s8a5edab2826324":"/","s7855e5e9727ea5":"博客","se2d4efa59baa78":"技术博客","sade1f3011512e1":"2025.07.26","s7632f5de2afbd2":"HAMi vGPU 原理分析 Part4：Spread&Binpack 高级调度策略实现","s0e3d8855d6491c":"密","sc6e4b855eea2d7":"密瓜智能","sc36f8a800aae26":"发布团队","s2e312abf3b5bec":"复制原文链接","sded4cf2bd394f4":"GPU 调度 Spread 与 Binpack","s537a018b54b536":"技术原理 · 工程实践 · 开源洞察","sec7580fa3d47ab":"DYNAMIA · OPEN SOURCE & AI INFRASTRUCTURE","s7ec9ef2c098627":"本文为 HAMi 原理分析的第四篇，分析 hami-scheduler 在调度时是如何选择节点的，即：Spread、Binpack 等高级调度策略是怎么实现的。","sff2fbf24e8af48":"本文目录 · 5 节","s3b2d0794ee6f67":"文章目录","s938db8c9f82c8c":"01","sf5ef9152022d6e":"策略配置","sa953f09a1b6b67":"02","s699dc26b3a0afe":"节点调度机制","s0b8efa5a3bf104":"03","sa79b87ee25d905":"GPU 调度机制","s6cd5b6e51936a4":"04","s5102e308c49241":"设备信息解析","sc97550ce8213ef":"05","s6bf8bdb1f6eefa":"小结","s88bb5e43888a51":"上篇我们分析了 hami-scheduler 工作流程，知道了 hami-webhook、hami-scheduler 是怎么配合工作的。","sabd19c89df92c9":"HAMi vGPU 原理分析 Part3：hami-scheduler 工作流程分析","scabdb62e6a223b":"这篇文章我们解决最后一个问题：","s886a137631242f":"Spread、Binpack 等高级调度策略是怎么实现的","s2bcae55453b831":"以下分析基于 HAMi v2.4.0","sf5de84a8581535":"这里在贴一下上一篇总结的 HAMi Webhook、Scheduler 工作流程：","seeca4747e07a89":"HAMi 调度器工作流程图","s5ab4743bcd7d88":"图1: HAMi 调度器工作流程图","s93c4a4836d3314":"用户创建 Pod 并在 Pod 中申请了 vGPU 资源","s953543739e2e47":"kube-apiserver 根据 MutatingWebhookConfiguration 配置请求 HAMi-Webhook","s9e1a2256ec069f":"HAMi-Webhook 检测 Pod 中的 Resource，发现是申请的由 HAMi 管理的 vGPU 资源，因此把 Pod 中的 SchedulerName 改成了 hami-scheduler，这样这个 Pod 就会由 hami-scheduler 进行调度了。","s34d28e90103815":"对于特权模式的 Pod，Webhook 会直接跳过不处理","s4e08d3801dc582":"对于使用 vGPU 资源但指定了 nodeName 的 Pod，Webhook 会直接拒绝","s57491d86782e1a":"hami-scheduler 进行 Pod 调度，不过就是用的 k8s 的默认 kube-scheduler 镜像，因此调度逻辑和默认的 default-scheduler 是一样的，kube-scheduler 根据 KubeSchedulerConfiguration 配置，调用 Extender Scheduler 插件","s1ffd949b6352c1":"这个 Extender Scheduler 就是 hami-scheduler Pod 中的另一个 Container，该 Container 同时提供了 Webhook 和 Scheduler 相关 API。","s54794d9c4156e0":"当 Pod 申请了 vGPU 资源时，kube-scheduler 就会根据配置以 HTTP 形式调用 Extender Scheduler 插件，这样就实现了自定义调度逻辑","s6ed652ada81464":"Extender Scheduler 插件包含了真正的 hami 调度逻辑，调度时根据节点剩余资源量进行打分选择节点","s6267c428714af8":"异步任务，包括 GPU 感知逻辑","s1c8a35fe59b61d":"devicePlugin 中的后台 Goroutine 定时上报 Node 上的 GPU 资源并写入到 Node 的 Annoations","sda84935ecef64a":"Extender Scheduler 插件根据 Node Annoations 解析出 GPU 资源总量、从 Node 上已经运行的 Pod 的 Annoations 中解析出 GPU 使用量，计算出每个 Node 剩余的可用资源保存到内存供调度时使用","sb4720bf9736f5a":"配置调度策略","s46f93afcf26794":"hami-scheduler 提供了两种不同级别的调度策略：","s653b3e9724ee46":"点调度策略：作用于调度过程中如何为 Pod 选择节点","sfcb48ec6bd914b":"GPU 调度策略：作用于选择节点后，节点存在多 GPU 时如何为 Pod 选择 GPU","s1868ed46e92562":"根据部署文档，我们可以在部署时指定调度策略","s5559b8beb3eaf2":"scheduler.defaultSchedulerPolicy.nodeSchedulerPolicy: 字符串类型，预设值为\"binpack\"，表示 GPU 节点调度策略。","scf2df02f5f4b9d":"（\"binpack\"表示尽量将任务分配到同一个 GPU 节点上； \"spread\"表示尽量将任务分配到不同 GPU 节点上。）","s3f5a5cd5c4836d":"scheduler.defaultSchedulerPolicy.gpuSchedulerPolicy: 字符串类型，预设值为\"spread\", 表示 GPU 调度策略。","s58a289f6f48d48":"（\"binpack\"表示尽量将任务分配到同一个 GPU 上；\"spread\"表示尽量将任务分配到不同 GPU 上。）","s33c8432e59978e":"就像这样：","s9ea987fcfde18a":"helm install vgpu vgpu-charts/vgpu \\\n  --","s6ee0eb490ff832":"set","s6899ead99c5864":" scheduler.defaultSchedulerPolicy.nodeSchedulerPolicy=binpark \\\n  --","s16b208b0b01e48":" scheduler.defaultSchedulerPolicy.gpuSchedulerPolicy=spread\n","sb380e99d52c5cf":"部署后，这两个配置作用域 hami-scheduler 上具体如下：","s111d0e0c3c7afe":"apiVersion:","s024614bbf9753e":"apps/v1","s08863725c9d14a":"kind:","s870a8ffd98f4f2":"Deployment","s8c8c42289a1387":"metadata:","sd0d6d503f5acae":"name:","sdde2872dff4b6f":"vgpu-hami-scheduler","sdecf94c04e0427":"namespace:","s88007f70666dbd":"kube-system","s36184fa5172f39":"spec:","sa58565b2f1aa8e":"template:","s04968f51ee0482":"containers:","s3973e022e93220":"-","s8ff7327fcdf50a":"command:","sa02ba163f3a02d":"scheduler","s6fca593117b071":"--resource-name=nvidia.com/gpu","sa2627a231fba53":"--resource-mem=nvidia.com/gpumem","s1c14a7f4891fa0":"--resource-cores=nvidia.com/gpucores","sceab7594170474":"--resource-mem-percentage=nvidia.com/gpumem-percentage","sc8e55fc15805fe":"--resource-priority=nvidia.com/priority","s16c87404aa2f74":"--http_bind=0.0.0.0:443","s2adaee0e7b0a3f":"--cert_file=/tls/tls.crt","s1db90acdb53594":"--key_file=/tls/tls.key","s2d4202ddf9ba0f":"--scheduler-name=hami-scheduler","s68e960796df157":"--metrics-bind-address=:9395","s7f161624994ad8":"--default-mem=0","s9ff181d7ca56b3":"--default-gpu=1","sd32f9916ad839c":"--default-cores=0","s9e7fc6e267efee":"--iluvatar-memory=iluvatar.ai/vcuda-memory","sff95ebd77f4603":"--iluvatar-cores=iluvatar.ai/vcuda-core","s268309e6ff54ed":"--cambricon-mlu-name=cambricon.com/vmlu","s355f63436a3807":"--cambricon-mlu-memory=cambricon.com/mlu.smlu.vmemory","s367a855ab20cdd":"--cambricon-mlu-cores=cambricon.com/mlu.smlu.vcore","s599f983cece8f0":"--ascend-name=huawei.com/Ascend910","s017285db952ab5":"--ascend-memory=huawei.com/Ascend910-memory","s70b8f66e94959f":"--ascend310p-name=huawei.com/Ascend310P","se1e1586a51554f":"--ascend310p-memory=huawei.com/Ascend310P-memory","se1365961049f3b":"--overwrite-env=false","s03d7dc28fe0db3":"--node-scheduler-policy=binpack","s36ddf947dc3bb0":"--gpu-scheduler-policy=spread","s13bedddbe676a2":"就是这两个参数","seea836d9ae8076":"2. Node 调度策略原理","sb423928115c9d3":"这部分比较简单，选择节点的逻辑就在 Filter 接口中。","s604ed3d7137f2d":"// pkg/scheduler/scheduler.go#L444","sf63827270b1643":"func","s99cd591dd08182":"(s *Scheduler)","s64aace81dc7001":" Filter(args extenderv1.ExtenderArgs) (*extenderv1.ExtenderFilterResult, ","sca00fccfb40898":"error","s51b7b35212cea3":") {\n    klog.InfoS(","sa051d60b752e93":"\"begin schedule filter\"","s0a07f659461970":", ","s058595d42bc109":"\"pod\"","s8476dc0d4d8aa6":", args.Pod.Name, ","sa945e7407a1b88":"\"uuid\"","s44950108f329e0":", args.Pod.UID, ","s3436b57192d804":"\"namespaces\"","s7b8ff2c9a718ad":", args.Pod.Namespace)\n    nums := k8sutil.Resourcereqs(args.Pod)\n    total := ","s5feceb66ffc86f":"0","s10c22bcf4c768b":"for","sfea34afc9